# Docker build context filter.
#
# The images rebuild everything they need from tracked source, so anything that is
# regenerated inside the build (dependencies, build output) or that is local-only (environment
# files, reports, private assessment material) is excluded here.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, because the build needs them:
#   prisma/                 schema, migrations, migration lock and the seed
#   fixtures/demo/          the seed's tracked sample files
#   apps/*/src              application source
#   *.json / pnpm-lock.yaml / pnpm-workspace.yaml / prisma7.config.ts / tsconfig.base.json

# Version control and local tooling
.git
.githooks
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*~

# Dependencies and build output — rebuilt inside the image
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/api/dist
apps/web/.next
apps/web/next-env.d.ts
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local environment files and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
.credentials/

# Test and developer tooling that the runtime does not need
e2e
apps/api/test
apps/api/scripts

# Documentation and private assessment material
docs
assessment
Notarify_Fullstack_developer_task.pdf
*.log
logs
tmp
.tmp
